# Every text file is LF in every checkout, Windows included: the generated
# firmware files, scenes.yaml and the parity fixtures are compared byte for
# byte, and a core.autocrlf checkout would turn each of them into a diff.
* text=auto eol=lf

# The card's scene files are binary records (tools/cue_file.py,
# tools/scene_manifest.py), never text to be converted.
*.cue binary
*.man binary
*.mp3 binary
*.wav binary
